WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
- All right, before we roll the credits,

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.430
I wanna share one final
heartwarming story for the day.

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:05.589
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:08.400
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.760
Today is the last day of
National Nurses Month,

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.250
but let's be honest, these past two years

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.490
have proven every day is a good day

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.300
to show gratitude to our nurses.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.130
I think we all agree on that.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.480
Sorry, I'm losing my voice.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.780
You may be familiar with the
Northwell Health Nurse Choir.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:28.160
They were featured on
AGT, got the golden buzzer

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.680
from Howie and made it to
the coveted top 10 spot.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.060
And I'm happy to say the
choir's still going strong.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.620
Bur bur bur!

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.870
We have one of the members

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.470
on the line right now with an update.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.440
So let's say hi to nurse Keisha

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.541
who watches on NBC New York.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:44.475
(audience applause and cheers)

00:00:44.475 --> 00:00:45.750
Hi, Keisha!

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:46.583
- Kelly.

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.580
- Oh my gosh. You have a beautiful smile.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.310
I'm gonna lead with that.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:51.570
So for those who don't know

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.330
tell us more about your
very special choir.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.680
- All right. So we formed back in 2020

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.160
as part of a virtual concert
for Nurse Heroes Live.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.040
We come from all different specialties.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.800
We come from New York and we're a part

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:08.310
of 19,000 nurses in our health
system, Northwell Health.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.740
And we did a virtual concert back in 2020.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:15.700
We auditioned for America's
Got Talent for season 16.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.700
It's just crazy.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.200
You know, it's a monumental moment

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.600
in my life and it's something
that I would never forget.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.460
And, you know, in light of
nurses, National Nurses Month,

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.530
we performed all across New York

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:29.270
for our peers and our
colleagues and our profession.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:30.990
And we're just so honored.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.140
Matter of fact, a couple
days ago, we performed

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:38.140
at Side by Side, which is a two
day national Northwell event

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:41.070
that honors military workers and veterans

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:43.540
and their families and healthcare workers.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:47.300
Jason Derulo opened, and
John legend headlined.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.160
- Ahhh.
- And, you know, it was just

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:49.589
so crazy to be there.

00:01:49.589 --> 00:01:52.230
Just hope to continue spreading this love

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.480
and this joy and this hope and healing

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.830
through our music, honestly.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:00.410
We provide care at the
bedside every single day.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:02.520
And it's just, it's just
an honor that we're able

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:04.680
to do that with our voices

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:08.377
to impact our listeners
and impact America.

00:02:08.377 --> 00:02:09.340
(audience applause)

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.520
- Absolutely. I bet that
was a good show too.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:12.950
Y'all singing Jason and John.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:14.700
That was probably really
great. Oh, that's awesome.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:15.810
- Just to have our name

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:18.780
in the same sentence as
John Legend is an honor.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.850
- Oh my gosh. I'm with
you. I feel the same way.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:25.763
So, I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:27.061 --> 00:02:28.051
- [Keisha] Thank you, Kelly!

00:02:28.051 --> 00:02:29.000
- And that's not all!

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.600
Our season long partner,
Pilot pen makers of G2,

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.430
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.910
want to honor ultimate
overachievers just like you ma'am.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.280
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.350
for a thousand dollars.

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:39.410
How's that sound?

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.722
(audience cheers and applause)

00:02:40.722 --> 00:02:43.280
- What?! Oh my goodness.
Thank you so much!

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:46.097
- I know. Have some,
have some fun with that!

